{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"OESA-2026-4876","published":"2026-11-19T01:42:36Z","modified":"2026-11-19T02:00:05.431331398Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-97631"],"summary":"edk2 security update","details":"EDK II is a modern, feature-rich, cross-platform firmware development environment for the UEFI and PI specifications.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nEDK2 contains a vulnerability in BIOS where a user may cause “Out-of-bounds\nWrite”, Classic\nBuffer Overflow, and “Incorrect Calculation of Buffer Size” by remote access. Successful exploitation of this vulnerability\ncan lead to arbitrary\ncode execution. It could also impact\nConfidentiality,\nIntegrity,\nand Availability.(CVE-2026-97631)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"edk2","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/edk2&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"202308-51.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["edk2-debuginfo-202308-51.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","edk2-debugsource-202308-51.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","edk2-devel-202308-51.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["edk2-aarch64-202308-51.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm","edk2-help-202308-51.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm","edk2-ovmf-202308-51.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm","python3-edk2-devel-202308-51.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["edk2-202308-51.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["edk2-debuginfo-202308-51.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","edk2-debugsource-202308-51.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","edk2-devel-202308-51.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-4876.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-4876"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-97631"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"Critical"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:H/SI:H/SA:H"}]}